option.SOLAS_BY_SEPTONIOUS.comment=Original author: Septonious (Solas Shader)\nDeveloper: Anatyi\nRepository: https://github.com/Anatyi/Solas-Shader-Classic\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/4uTAUQR2xu GitHub: https://github.com/Septonious/Solas-Shader\nChangelog (V2.3.3):\n- Ported 3.7 volumetric clouds (VC_3_7) and planar clouds (PLANAR_CLOUDS_3_7)\n- Ported 3.7 Overworld sky (SKY_3_7), stars (STARS_3_7) and generated night nebula\n- Ported 3.7 End: nebula (END_NEBULA_3_7), black hole (lensing + vortex), starfield, protoplanetary disk / End clouds\n- Ported 3.7 Nether: smoke (NETHER_SMOKE_3_7) and LPV fog noise (LPV_FOG_NOISE)\n- Gravity vortex controls: strength / range, negative values allowed; starfield density independent of the End nebula\n- End disk glass culling, End reflection fix, fade-distance controls for End clouds\n- Reorganized Sky & Atmosphere menus (switch + config two-column layout)\n- Fixed: End starfield visibility, LPV fog noise energy, vortex/range controls

