#=======================================================# FIXES #=======================================================#

screen.FIXES=Fixes

option.FIXES=Enable Fixes
option.FIXES.comment=These are fixes for issues identified as bugs introduced unintentionally by the shader or by updates since this release. Except for the critical bugs that had to be removed (not listed), the remaining optional fixes are enabled by default for better expected results. If you think some fixes in the list are actually features, turn them off. Fixes that some mainline versions considered below expectations are disabled by default.

option.LPV_FOG_FIX_GLOBAL=LPV Fog Fix: Global
option.LPV_FOG_FIX_GLOBAL.comment=Suppresses LPV (light) fog overexposure everywhere (global). When off, only the High-freq switch (if on) limits overexposure where many light sources stack up. Default off.
option.LPV_FOG_FIX_HIGH_FREQ=LPV Fog Fix: High-freq Only
option.LPV_FOG_FIX_HIGH_FREQ.comment=Suppresses LPV fog overexposure only where many light sources stack up, keeping single/few lights at the vanilla strength. Default on.
option.LPV_FOG_HF_THRESHOLD=High-freq Threshold
option.LPV_FOG_HF_THRESHOLD.comment=Floodfill brightness above which a sample counts as "many light sources" (high frequency). Higher = fewer samples suppressed.
option.LPV_FOG_HF_BANDWIDTH=High-freq Bandwidth
option.LPV_FOG_HF_BANDWIDTH.comment=Smooth transition range around the high-freq threshold.
option.LPV_FOG_HF_SUPPRESS=High-freq Suppress
option.LPV_FOG_HF_SUPPRESS.comment=How much the light fog is scaled down where many light sources stack up. 0 = fully removed, 1 = vanilla.
option.LPV_FOG_DARK_VISIBILITY=Dark Space Fog Visibility
option.LPV_FOG_DARK_VISIBILITY.comment=How much the light fog visibility is boosted in dark/enclosed spaces. 0 = 3.7 default (no boost); 1 = vanilla boost (can overexpose).
option.LPV_FOG_BRIGHT_FADE=Bright Environment Fade
option.LPV_FOG_BRIGHT_FADE.comment=How strongly the light fog fades out in bright surface environments (3.7 default 3.0). Higher values suppress bright-environment fog more.
option.LPV_FOG_DARK_DENSITY=Dark Space Fog Density
option.LPV_FOG_DARK_DENSITY.comment=How much the light fog density is boosted in dark/enclosed spaces. 0 = 3.7 default (no boost); 1 = vanilla density 40 (can overexpose).